  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Greenfield lifecycle control plane informed by ISO/IEC/IEEE 12207:2026, from stakeholder needs through retirement.\n- One strict repository schema, UUIDv7 identities, canonical typed collections, platform-aware component bindings, and explicit lifecycle roles.\n- Separate file-backed knowledge workspaces, cited sources/observations, canonical records, generated BRD/TRD views, contextual evidence, review packets, validation, and gates.\n- Context-bound evidence signatures, typed trace links, iterative stage history, and continuous controls.\n- Agent-first lifecycle setup with role-specific BA, product, architecture, development, QA, security, operations, coordination, and audit prompts.\n- A loopback-only reviewer portal launched directly from the CLI with embedded client assets and repository discovery through octoevidence.json.",
